a&_nc_ohc=V50IXhHv8gMQ7kNvwE7N_IG&_nc_oc=AdohmEmaCNiYHTSl9E3jHfuQVO0mJAgo1cao3aFfPebqw7_nhpkQEFXUoczFexWYR48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAJXXIUVuDyJWhvq3CJfiKV2USCZAkBJkf5wYqbC8cmMg&oe=6A6CB4C6"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_007_0003.png", "id": "845763184505694", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_845763187839027_468447991220621964_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LckI6DXsTzoQ7kNvwF_QaqM&_nc_oc=AdqlPTAIddUeqmvFhoXG-dab0kOsoT9mj7H8GkY1vEBJuASRnfGJrc7pfcYhbzes__I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD4qM9QNYwtnE1GD8zmPAGkNQnJa8WEmkxzugfoMRaioQ&oe=6A6CA22C"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_003_0002.png", "id": "1836602476962685", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_1836602480296018_8280261062432359374_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tKd3bzUQSEYQ7kNvwEv-npf&_nc_oc=AdqWPZ8mt4DKqUGMybUjr1a_xciJ2U_FmPzmJfy39Fvw3HW1tf41NsFLsLSpae6TFCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCRBdahMdGG6Kjpg304154VBUe7ievo0LbZlOXDFdMUNQ&oe=6A6C9F03"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_004_0000.png", "id": "1138993271704566", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1138993275037899_3311993198849045458_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QjxD6hT0Id4Q7kNvwEBIYJB&_nc_oc=AdrHnCxLPuu-3nOsN8Xvlb4fydVXRY7K0w-70QeVDKQQrYs8EpdQUJj_X9bddcfSZMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCQ9O1Y4vWOMyNYYoKQ7VnCuM7sajCubZhfWL-JvyJrew&oe=6A6CA213"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_006_0001.png", "id": "847449181015275", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_847449184348608_15613528115627936_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fRpI1sPbYlkQ7kNvwFIrWEP&_nc_oc=AdqIo6r--VVE5UUtZlnEjJc70OCyhjeaha2DU3-ClW6UAbF_Ob8tf27Nr8z9D1SPXcw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCmKWMydE6__jRa_0R7Jy0bOl7ZVVYnXB9O_tcShytaLA&oe=6A6C9B81"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zibby", "keywords": ["social", "casual", "free", "gorilla", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Zibby!\n\nZibby is not just game. Zibby is lifestyle. Enter the world, be the Zibby.\n\n# Bonk & Snack\nSee that Spitflower? It has gems inside. BONK the Spitflower. Gem falls out? Don't put in pocket. EAT IT. Crunchy victory.\n\n{847821848000023}\n\n# Shop Like a Boss\nWhy look boring? Go to store. We have everything! Buy funny hat. Buy cool gadget. Buy shiny things. Look fresh, impress friends. Spend your hard-earned cash here.\n\n{1280599737210708}\n\n# Dig Deep, Eat Dark\nGrab pickaxe. Find rock. Smash rock! Oh look, coal pieces! Are you hungry? Yes. Eat the coal. Mining is tasty work.\n\n{2308405566240054}\n\n# Zoom and Boing\nWalking is for slow people. Use Jumppad: BOING! Fly high. Use Zipline: WHOOSH! Go fast. Explore the world like a pro. Never touch ground again.\n\n{722552094239314}\n\n# The Circle of Life\nSimple life. Good life. Walk -> Grab -> Bonk Mob -> EAT. Mine Rock -> Get Coal -> EAT. -> Sell loot -> Get rich -> Repeat. This is the Zibby way.\n\n{3001593293368798}\n\n**Rise through the skies. Serve the kingdom. Become Zibby.**\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Explore floating island biomes as Zibby, servant of the kingdom. Team up with friends to hunt monsters, mine rare resources, and uncover secrets across a vast sky-realm. Collect valuable drops, sell them in the castle safe zone, and upgrade your gear. New islands, enemies, and tools arrive with every update\u2014your adventure never stops!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://liminagames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Limina Games", "support_website_url": "https://liminagames.com/discord", "website_url": "https://liminagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST"